@startuml Component Architecture - Improved
scale 0.7
!theme blueprint
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName Inter, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam defaultFontColor #1A1A1A
skinparam componentFontColor #0D0D0D
skinparam arrowFontColor #262626
skinparam packageFontColor #0D0D0D
skinparam queueFontColor #0D0D0D
skinparam databaseFontColor #0D0D0D
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam padding 3
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam noteFontColor #0D0D0D

title **Large Payload Processing - Improved** - With Cache & DLQ

package "Frontend Layer" #FFFFFF {
    [simul-frontend] as frontend #7EB8F5
}

package "Orchestration Layer" #FFFFFF {
    [simul-orchestrator] as orchestrator #5FE5D6
}

package "Message Broker" #FFFFFF {
    queue "processingNG" as topicNG #85C1E9
    queue "processing" as topicLegacy #85C1E9
    queue "payload.failed" as dlq #FFB6C1

    package "NG Queue Group" #F8FCFF {
        queue "rr1-ng-queue" as ngQ1 #AED9F7
        queue "rr2-ng-queue" as ngQ2 #AED9F7
        queue "rr3-ng-queue" as ngQ3 #AED9F7
    }

    package "Legacy Queue Group" #FFFAF0 {
        queue "rr1-queue" as q1 #FBD89A
        queue "rr2-queue" as q2 #FBD89A
        queue "rr3-queue" as q3 #FBD89A
    }
}

package "Caching Layer" #FFFFFF {
    [Redis Cache] <<LRU Cache>> as cache #FFDAB9
}

package "Consumer Layer" #FFFFFF {
    [processingNG-kafka-consumer] as consumerNG #C7A2D6
    [processing-kafka-consumer] as consumerLegacy #C7A2D6
}

package "Processing Layer" #FFFFFF {
    [external-engine] as engine #7ED8A3
    [external-engineNG] as engineNG #7ED8A3
}

package "Persistence Layer" #FFFFFF {
    database "postgreNgDB" as dbNG #5FE5D6
    database "postgreDB" as dbLegacy #5FE5D6
}

' ==========================
' MAIN DATA FLOW
' ==========================
frontend ..down..> orchestrator: **[1]** HTTP Stream\n(1GB payload)

orchestrator ..down..> topicNG: **[2a]** Publish
orchestrator ..down..> topicLegacy: **[2b]** Publish

' Fan-out to partitions
topicNG ..down..> ngQ1: **[3a]** Fan-out
topicNG ..down..> ngQ2: **[3a]** Fan-out
topicNG ..down..> ngQ3: **[3a]** Fan-out

topicLegacy ..down..> q1: **[3b]** Fan-out
topicLegacy ..down..> q2: **[3b]** Fan-out
topicLegacy ..down..> q3: **[3b]** Fan-out

' Consumers poll from partitions
ngQ1 ..down..> consumerNG: **[4a]** Consume
ngQ2 ..down..> consumerNG: **[4a]** Consume
ngQ3 ..down..> consumerNG: **[4a]** Consume

q1 ..down..> consumerLegacy: **[4b]** Consume
q2 ..down..> consumerLegacy: **[4b]** Consume
q3 ..down..> consumerLegacy: **[4b]** Consume

' ==========================
' CACHE INTEGRATION
' ==========================
consumerNG ..right..> cache: **[5a]** Check\nCache
cache ..left..> consumerNG: Hit/Miss

consumerLegacy ..right..> cache: **[5b]** Check\nCache
cache ..left..> consumerLegacy: Hit/Miss

' ==========================
' PROCESSING FLOW
' ==========================
consumerNG ..down..> engineNG: **[6a]** Forward\n(NG)\nCache Miss

consumerLegacy ..down..> engine: **[6b]** Forward\n(Legacy)\nCache Miss

' ==========================
' PERSISTENCE FLOW
' ==========================
engineNG ..down..> dbNG: **[7a]** Persist
engine ..down..> dbLegacy: **[7b]** Persist

' Update cache on success
engineNG ..up..> cache: **[8a]** Update\nCache
engine ..up..> cache: **[8b]** Update\nCache

' ==========================
' ERROR HANDLING - DLQ
' ==========================
consumerNG ..left..> dlq: **[X]** Max Retries\nExhausted
consumerLegacy ..left..> dlq: **[X]** Permanent\nFailure

' ==========================
' NOTES
' ==========================
note right of cache #FFF9E6
  **Caching Strategy**
  • TTL: 15 minutes
  • LRU eviction policy
  • Key: hash(payloadId)
  • Reduces duplicate processing
  • Target hit ratio: 80%+

  **Benefits:**
  • Avoids redundant DB queries
  • Reduces processing latency
  • Handles duplicate messages
end note

note right of dlq #FFE4E1
  **Dead Letter Queue**
  • Max retries: 3 attempts
  • Backoff: Exponential (30s, 90s, 270s)
  • Triggers:
    - Deserialization errors
    - Business logic failures
    - Persistent DB errors

  **Monitoring:**
  • Alert on depth > 10
  • Daily manual review
  • Replay capability
end note

note bottom of engine #FFF9E6
  **Success Response:**
  Returns HTTP 200 OK
  on successful persistence
  + updates cache
end note

note bottom of engineNG #FFF9E6
  **Success Response:**
  Returns HTTP 200 OK
  on successful persistence
  + updates cache
end note

' ==========================
' LEGEND
' ==========================
legend right
  |= **Symbol** |= **Meaning** |
  | <#7EB8F5> | Frontend Components |
  | <#5FE5D6> | Orchestration/Data |
  | <#C7A2D6> | Consumers |
  | <#7ED8A3> | Processing Engines |
  | <#FFDAB9> | **Caching Layer** |
  | <#FFB6C1> | **Dead Letter Queue** |
  |= |= |
  | Dotted lines | Async messaging |
  | **[N]** | Processing sequence |
  | **[X]** | Error path |
endlegend

@enduml
